WEBVTT

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.096
On my t-shirt, on my hair

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.576
Sing a prayer, hit the drum

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:34.736
The rain is gonna come

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.896
This heat is hard to bear

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.976
This heat is hard to bear

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.896
Just get a pumper

