Just get a pumper

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.416
This heat is hard to bear

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.456
This heat is hard to bear

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.656
Just get a pumper

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.856
Just get a pumper

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.680
This heat is hard to bear

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.896
